    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Mary Elizabeth \"Mimi\" Smith (\"née\" Stanley; 24 April 1906 – 6 December 1991) was the maternal aunt and parental guardian of the English musician, John Lennon. Mimi Stanley was born in Toxteth, Liverpool, England, the oldest of five daughters. She became a resident trainee nurse at the Woolton Convalescent Hospital and later worked as a private secretary. On 15 September 1939 she married George Smith who ran his family's dairy farm and a shop in Woolton, a suburb of Liverpool.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999965391169,
